  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The submitted Noise Impact Assessment and Odour Impact Assessment fails to demonstrate that the existing extraction, ventilation and odour control system can operate effectively at maximum normal operating levels without causing unacceptable noise, vibration and odour impacts to the residential accommodation above the premises. In the absence of sufficient evidence to assess worst-case operating conditions and the effects of airborne and structure-borne noise transmission, the proposal fails to safeguard the amenities of neighbouring occupiers and is therefore contrary to Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan 2021–2041, Policy D14 of the London Plan (2021), and the National Planning Policy Framework (2026) requiring development to protect residential amenity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
